\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}finite\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}finite\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Totality and single-valuedness are carried by the function signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\">\\(\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\)</span>; finiteness of the state set is explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (alphabet, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}finite\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land\n0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\n\\de